# Archetype Orchestrator: Cline Rules

## Open Brain Search: MANDATORY for Every Task
**MANDATORY: Search open-brain at the START of EVERY task. No exceptions.** Do this BEFORE your first action. Run two searches: one for the task topic, one for "user preferences formatting rules". This applies to every task: coding, debugging, docs, research, refactoring, reviews, questions. Every task. Period.

## Task Lifecycle
- Pre-work:  `bash scripts/pre-work-check.sh "task description"`
- Post-work: `bash scripts/post-work-check.sh "what I tested and what passed"`
- Always work on feature branches

## Spec Discovery
- Scan:  `python archetype-orchestrator/engine/discover.py --scan`
- Route: `python archetype-orchestrator/engine/discover.py --query "keywords"`
- Read the matched constitution before working

## Validation
- `bash scripts/post-work-check.sh "what I tested and what passed"`

## Context
- Read `docs/planning/CONTEXT_CHECKPOINTS.md` at session start
- Write: `bash scripts/context-checkpoint.sh "milestone"`

## Planning Documents (docs/planning/)
- DUAL_AGENT_WORKFLOW.md
- CONTEXT_LOOP.md
- RALPH_LOOP.md
- SOURCE_CONSULTATION_MAP.md
